00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,645
Which vial is stronger: ten milligrams, or five?

2
00:00:03,645 --> 00:00:04,726
Trick question.

3
00:00:04,726 --> 00:00:06,406
A vial has no strength.

4
00:00:06,406 --> 00:00:09,114
Ten milligrams is simply more peptide.

5
00:00:09,114 --> 00:00:12,539
In one milligram portions, it holds ten portions.

6
00:00:12,539 --> 00:00:14,570
Five milligrams holds five.

7
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:17,122
And water never changes the amount.

8
00:00:17,122 --> 00:00:19,414
One milligram is one milligram.

9
00:00:19,414 --> 00:00:26,197
More water only means each portion takes more volume, and more units on a U-100 scale.

